    <miscellaneous>
      <miscellaneous-field name="analysis-json">{"meta":{"id":"satie_gymnopedie_1","parent_item_id":"satie_gymnopedie_1","title":"Gymnopédie No. 1","composer":"Erik Satie","source_file":"files/scores/satie_gymnopedie_1.mid","quarter_range":[0,141.0],"bar_quarters":3.0,"time_signature":"3/4","key":"D","tempo":60.0,"midi_play_url":"files/scores/satie_gymnopedie_1.mid","source_licence":"PD","notation_notes":"Mutopia MIDI (PD edition, piece 37): 47 bars of 3/4 from quarter 0, no pickup, MIDI tempo 60 per quarter, key signature 2 sharps. The MIDI does NOT unfold the repeat: bars 1–39 are the first half with its first ending (bars 32–39, closing on D major), and bars 40–47 follow directly as the second ending (printed bars 71–78 in a written-out edition, closing on D minor). The repeated bars 1–31 are not played a second time. Bars 9–12 carry an F#4 quarter on beat 1 in the treble track (doubling the chord's F#4); not checked against a printed edition. Texture throughout: bass dotted half on beat 1, chord on beats 2–3, melody above. MIDI-derived score, not an Urtext.","source_page":"https://www.mutopiaproject.org/cgibin/piece-info.cgi?id=37","suggested_arrangement_tempo":60,"sustain_events":[]},"draft":false,"reviewed_by":"claude-opus-5-5 (MusicBot) 2026-10-11","summary":"D major, 3/4, slow (quarter = 60). Every bar is bass on beat 1 and a chord on beats 2–3, one harmony per bar. A four-bar Gmaj7–Dmaj7 sway (IVmaj7–Imaj7, F#4 common in both) carries the theme (bars 5–12, restated 13–21). The bass then steps out (iii–vi–ii) to a borrowed D minor (bar 21). A second melody (22–31) sits over a nine-bar D pedal that alternates Em7, Am (minor v), D7 and Dm7. The first ending (32–39) closes with Mixolydian v7 → I. In this MIDI the repeat is not unfolded: the second ending (40–47) follows straight away and turns to D minor over an E pedal, ending v7 → i.","sections":[{"name":"Intro","start_bar":1,"end_bar":4,"mood":["still","hypnotic"],"description":"Gmaj7–Dmaj7 sway alone."},{"name":"A: theme","start_bar":5,"end_bar":12,"mood":["wistful","gentle"],"description":"Melody F#–A–G–F#–C#–B–C#–D–A over the sway, held A4 to bar 12; plagal close at bar 8."},{"name":"A': theme and continuation","start_bar":13,"end_bar":21,"mood":["wistful","searching"],"description":"Bars 13–16 repeat the theme; bass moves F#–B–E–E–D (iii–vi–ii–ii7–borrowed i). Nine-bar phrase ending on held E4 over Dm(add9)."},{"name":"B: second melody over D pedal","start_bar":22,"end_bar":31,"mood":["melancholy","floating"],"description":"Two five-bar phrases (22–26, 27–31) over a tonic pedal from bar 23; Em7/D, Am/D, D7 and Dm7 mix major and minor tonic colour."},{"name":"Close (first ending)","start_bar":32,"end_bar":39,"mood":["lifting","resolved"],"description":"Bass E–F#–B–E pedal, melody rises to E5, ii9 → v7 → I in D major."},{"name":"Close (second ending)","start_bar":40,"end_bar":47,"mood":["darkening","resigned"],"description":"Same start as bar 32, then F natural, E pedal under Dm/E, Fmaj7/E, Am/E; Em7(b9) → Am7 → Dm."}],"mood":[{"start_bar":1,"end_bar":4,"labels":["still","hypnotic"]},{"start_bar":5,"end_bar":21,"labels":["wistful","gentle"]},{"start_bar":22,"end_bar":31,"labels":["melancholy","floating"]},{"start_bar":32,"end_bar":39,"labels":["lifting","resolved"]},{"start_bar":40,"end_bar":47,"labels":["darkening","resigned"]}],"tricks":["Bars 1–16: only two chords, Gmaj7 and Dmaj7, one per bar. They share F#4, so the right-hand chord barely changes while the bass swings G2–D2.","Bass on beat 1, chord on beats 2–3: the whole piece uses this slow waltz texture with about two octaves of empty space between bass and chord.","Bar 6: melody C#5 over Dmaj7 puts the major seventh on top, the piece's signature colour.","No leading note at the cadences: minor v (Am, Am7) replaces V in bars 22, 25, 28, 30, 38 and 46.","Bars 21 and 27: D minor appears right next to D major (borrowed i, i7), so the mode keeps shifting under the same bass.","Bars 23–31: nine bars of tonic pedal D2 under Em7, Am, D7 and Dm7.","Bars 40–47: the second ending replays the first-ending shape with F natural over an E pedal and closes in D minor."],"loop_candidates":[{"start_bar":1,"end_bar":4,"why":"Gmaj7–Dmaj7 ×2 with no melody; bar 4 Dmaj7 returns to bar 1 Gmaj7 exactly as in the piece.","quarter_range":[0,12]},{"start_bar":5,"end_bar":12,"why":"Full theme over the sway; bar 12 Dmaj7 → bar 5 Gmaj7 is the written return (bars 12 → 13).","quarter_range":[12,36]},{"start_bar":23,"end_bar":26,"why":"Em7/D–Em7/D–Am/D–D7 over the D pedal; D7 back to Em7/D keeps the pedal, but the melody seam needs listening.","quarter_range":[66,78],"requires_audition":true}],"hook_candidates":[{"start_bar":5,"end_bar":8,"why":"The famous opening melody F#–A | G–F#–C# | B–C#–D | A over IVmaj7–Imaj7.","quarter_range":[12,24]},{"start_bar":1,"end_bar":2,"why":"Gmaj7 → Dmaj7 bass-and-chord cell; recognisable without the melody.","quarter_range":[0,6]},{"start_bar":38,"end_bar":39,"why":"Am7 → D modal cadence (first ending close).","quarter_range":[111,117]}],"kpop_uses":[{"where":"verse","why":"Bars 1–4 / 5–12: the Gmaj7–Dmaj7 sway at quarter = 60 (or double-time feel at 120) gives a soft bed with a lot of room for a vocal."},{"where":"pre-chorus","why":"Bars 17–21: bass steps F#m–Bm–Em–Em7 to borrowed Dm(add9) under one held note; the shift to minor builds tension before a chorus."},{"where":"bridge","why":"Bars 22–31: D pedal with Em7, Am, D7 and Dm7 mixing major and minor; suits a hazy, floating bridge."},{"where":"chorus","why":"Bars 32–39 as an outro or final line: rising melody and Am7 → D close without a leading note. Bars 40–47 give a darker minor ending. There is no key lift in the source."}],"review_flags":[{"bar":1,"reason":"Draft split each bar into a \"?\" bass beat and a beats-2–3 chord. The bass dotted half sounds under the chord, so one chord per bar from beat 1 is used."},{"bar":1,"reason":"Tempo set to the MIDI value (quarter = 60); the draft said 100."},{"bar":33,"reason":"Draft key change D → A at bar 33 removed: no G# and no E–A cadence; A/E (bar 35) moves to iii42, not I. Read as D major through bar 39."},{"bar":40,"reason":"The MIDI does not unfold the repeat: bars 40–47 (second ending) follow bar 39 directly, and the repeat of bars 1–31 is missing. Bar numbers 40–47 here = printed 71–78 in a written-out edition."},{"bar":40,"reason":"D → d treated as a modulation for the second ending, since the piece ends in D minor. Bar 40 itself has no F; the F natural arrives at bar 41. A modal-mixture reading (D Dorian/Aeolian close) is also possible."},{"bar":25,"reason":"Am/D (bars 25, 28, 30) could also be named D7sus2 (D–E–A–C); music21 has no 7sus2 symbol, so it is labelled as minor v over the tonic pedal."},{"bar":9,"reason":"Bars 9–12: treble F#4 quarter on beat 1 doubles the chord F#4; source detail not checked against print."},{"bar":39,"reason":"Cadences in bars 39 and 47 are v7 → I/i with no leading note, so they are labelled tonic_close, not PAC/IAC. Draft IAC/HC candidates in bars 26, 28, 31, 38, 40 and 46 removed (no V present)."}],"schema_version":1,"bars":[{"bar":1,"start_quarter":0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"intro","text":"Intro bars 1–4: Gmaj7–Dmaj7 alternation alone"},{"type":"story","technique":"start","text":"start: a slow two-chord sway with no melody"},{"type":"hook","technique":"harmonic_cell","text":"Gmaj7 ↔ Dmaj7 (IVmaj7–Imaj7) one chord per bar: the signature two-bar cell"},{"type":"voicing_orchestration","technique":"open_spacing","text":"Low bass on beat 1 (G2/D2), close chord B3–D4–F#4 / A3–C#4–F#4 on beats 2–3: about two octaves of space between them"},{"type":"tension_release","technique":"pedal_point_inner","text":"F#4 sits in every beat-2 chord from bar 1 to bar 18 (Gmaj7, Dmaj7, F#m, Bm)"}]},{"bar":2,"start_quarter":3.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":3,"start_quarter":6.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[]},{"bar":4,"start_quarter":9.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":5,"start_quarter":12.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant; melody A5 on beat 3 is an added ninth"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"theme_1","text":"Theme bars 5–12: melody enters on beat 2"},{"type":"hook","technique":"melodic_cell","text":"F#5–A5 | G5–F#5–C#5 | B4–C#5–D5 | A4: the falling-and-rising melody over the IV–I sway","beat":2},{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"added_note","text":"Melody A5 adds the ninth to Gmaj7","beat":3}]},{"bar":6,"start_quarter":15.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"added_note","text":"Melody C#5 on beat 3 over Dmaj7 doubles the major seventh, the piece's signature colour","beat":3}]},{"bar":7,"start_quarter":18.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[]},{"bar":8,"start_quarter":21.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[{"type":"cadence","technique":"plagal","text":"IVmaj7 → Imaj7 with the melody held on A4 (5̂): soft plagal phrase close"},{"type":"story","technique":"continuation","text":"continuation: the sway continues under the held note (bars 8–12)"}]},{"bar":9,"start_quarter":24.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[]},{"bar":10,"start_quarter":27.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":11,"start_quarter":30.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[]},{"bar":12,"start_quarter":33.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":13,"start_quarter":36.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant; melody A5 on beat 3 is an added ninth"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"theme_1","text":"Theme restated (bars 13–21) exactly as bars 5–8, then it continues"},{"type":"motif","technique":"repetition","text":"Bars 13–16 repeat bars 5–8 note for note"}]},{"bar":14,"start_quarter":39.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":15,"start_quarter":42.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Gmaj7","rn":"IVmaj7","function":"subdominant major seventh; F#4 common tone"}],"events":[]},{"bar":16,"start_quarter":45.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmaj7","rn":"Imaj7","function":"tonic major seventh"}],"events":[]},{"bar":17,"start_quarter":48.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"F#m","rn":"iii","function":"mediant; melody C#5"}],"events":[{"type":"story","technique":"turn","text":"turn: the IV–I sway breaks; the bass steps out to F#, B, E"},{"type":"rhythm_phrase","technique":"phrase_length","text":"Phrase 13–21 is nine bars: four-bar melody plus a five-bar continuation ending on the held E4"}]},{"bar":18,"start_quarter":51.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Bm","rn":"vi","function":"submediant; melody F#5, phrase high point"}],"events":[{"type":"texture_dynamics","technique":"climax","text":"Melody F#5 over Bm, highest note of this phrase; held a full bar"}]},{"bar":19,"start_quarter":54.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em","rn":"ii","function":"supertonic; melody E4 held"}],"events":[{"type":"counterpoint","technique":"oblique_motion","text":"E4 held for three bars (19–21) while the harmony moves Em → Em7 → Dm(add9)"}]},{"bar":20,"start_quarter":57.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em7","rn":"ii7","function":"supertonic seventh; E4 still held"}],"events":[]},{"bar":21,"start_quarter":60.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dmadd9","rn":"i(add9) (mixture)","function":"borrowed tonic minor; held E4 becomes the ninth"}],"events":[{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"borrowed","text":"D minor (F natural) borrowed from the parallel minor; held E4 becomes its ninth"},{"type":"cadence","technique":"open_phrase","text":"Phrase ends on borrowed i(add9) with melody on 2̂; harmony left open"}]},{"bar":22,"start_quarter":63.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am","rn":"v","function":"minor dominant (Mixolydian colour, no C#)"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"theme_2","text":"Second melody bars 22–31 (A–B–C, E–D–B…) in the middle register"},{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"borrowed","text":"Minor v (A–C–E, no C#): Mixolydian dominant used here and in bars 25, 28, 30, 38"}]},{"bar":23,"start_quarter":66.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em7/D","rn":"ii42 / I pedal","function":"supertonic seventh over tonic pedal"}],"events":[{"type":"tension_release","technique":"pedal_point_tonic","text":"D2 bass on every downbeat bars 23–31 under Em7, Am, D7 and Dm7"},{"type":"bass_line","technique":"pedal","text":"Tonic pedal D2, bars 23–31"}]},{"bar":24,"start_quarter":69.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em7/D","rn":"ii42 / I pedal","function":"same; melody D–C–B"}],"events":[]},{"bar":25,"start_quarter":72.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am/D","rn":"v / I pedal","function":"minor dominant triad over tonic pedal (sounds D7sus2)"}],"events":[]},{"bar":26,"start_quarter":75.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"D7","rn":"I7","function":"tonic with flat seventh; V7/IV implied, not resolved"}],"events":[{"type":"cadence","technique":"open_phrase","text":"Phrase 22–26 ends on D7 (melody D5): tonic with flat seventh, no resolution to IV"}]},{"bar":27,"start_quarter":78.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dm7","rn":"i7 (mixture)","function":"borrowed minor tonic seventh; melody E–F–G passing"}],"events":[{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"borrowed","text":"Dm7 (F natural) directly after D7: major/minor tonic exchange over the pedal"},{"type":"motif","technique":"sequence","text":"Bars 27–28 restate the bar 22–23 melodic shape a step higher (E–F–G, A–C–D)"}]},{"bar":28,"start_quarter":81.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am/D","rn":"v / I pedal","function":"minor dominant over tonic pedal"}],"events":[]},{"bar":29,"start_quarter":84.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em7/D","rn":"ii42 / I pedal","function":"supertonic seventh over tonic pedal"}],"events":[{"type":"motif","technique":"repetition","text":"Bars 29–31 repeat bars 24–26 (Em7/D, Am/D, D7)"}]},{"bar":30,"start_quarter":87.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am/D","rn":"v / I pedal","function":"minor dominant over tonic pedal"}],"events":[]},{"bar":31,"start_quarter":90.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"D7","rn":"I7","function":"tonic with flat seventh; moves to ii, not IV"}],"events":[{"type":"cadence","technique":"open_phrase","text":"Phrase 27–31 ends on D7 again, then moves to ii"}]},{"bar":32,"start_quarter":93.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em","rn":"ii","function":"supertonic; first ending begins, melody G5"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"theme_tail","text":"First ending bars 32–39: rising scale melody to the close"},{"type":"story","technique":"arrival","text":"arrival: the bass leaves the pedal and steps E–F#–B; melody climbs C#–D–E toward the cadence"}]},{"bar":33,"start_quarter":96.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"F#m","rn":"iii","function":"mediant; melody F#5"}],"events":[]},{"bar":34,"start_quarter":99.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Bm","rn":"vi","function":"submediant; melody B–A–B"}],"events":[]},{"bar":35,"start_quarter":102.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"A/E","rn":"V64","function":"dominant 6/4 over E bass; passes on to iii42, not cadential"}],"events":[{"type":"bass_line","technique":"pedal","text":"E2 bass in bars 35–37 under A/E, F#m7/E, Em9"}]},{"bar":36,"start_quarter":105.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"F#m7/E","rn":"iii42","function":"mediant seventh over E bass"}],"events":[]},{"bar":37,"start_quarter":108.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em9","rn":"ii9","function":"supertonic ninth over E pedal; F#4 held above, inner voices move on beats 2–3"}],"events":[{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"added_note","text":"F#4 held over the Em7 inner voices: ninth"}]},{"bar":38,"start_quarter":111.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am7","rn":"v7","function":"minor dominant seventh (no C#)"}],"events":[]},{"bar":39,"start_quarter":114.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"D","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"D","rn":"I","function":"tonic, end of first ending"}],"events":[{"type":"cadence","technique":"tonic_close","text":"Am7 (v7) → D (I): modal cadence without leading note; melody ends D5"}]},{"bar":40,"start_quarter":117.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em","rn":"ii","function":"second ending: same opening as bar 32"}],"events":[{"type":"form","technique":"coda","text":"Second ending bars 40–47 (follows bar 39 directly in this MIDI): same start as bar 32, then turns to D minor"},{"type":"modulation","technique":"direct_phrase_modulation","text":"Second ending moves from D major to D minor; F natural enters at bar 41 and the piece ends on Dm","from_key":"D","to_key":"d"},{"type":"bass_line","technique":"pedal","text":"E2 bass held on every downbeat bars 40–45"}]},{"bar":41,"start_quarter":120.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Dm/E","rn":"i / E pedal","function":"tonic minor over E pedal; F natural enters (melody F5)"}],"events":[]},{"bar":42,"start_quarter":123.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Fmaj7/E","rn":"III42","function":"mediant major seventh over E pedal"}],"events":[{"type":"motif","technique":"repetition","text":"Bars 42–44 repeat the bar 34–36 melodic shape (B–C–F, E–D–C ×2) recoloured with F natural"}]},{"bar":43,"start_quarter":126.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am/E","rn":"v64","function":"minor dominant 6/4 over E pedal"}],"events":[]},{"bar":44,"start_quarter":129.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Fmaj7/E","rn":"III42","function":"mediant major seventh over E pedal"}],"events":[]},{"bar":45,"start_quarter":132.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Em7b9","rn":"ii7(b9)","function":"Dorian ii7 (B natural) with held F4 as flat ninth; E pedal ends"}],"events":[{"type":"colour_chord","technique":"added_note","text":"Held F4 over Em7: flat ninth, the D-minor version of bar 37's F#"}]},{"bar":46,"start_quarter":135.0,"duration_quarters":3.0,"key":"d","chords":[{"beat":1,"symbol":"Am7","rn":"v7","function":"minor dominan